      "title": "Retirement Income Estimate",
      "body": "Across the cautious, middle, and strong scenarios, the estimated portfolio-supported income is $57,123 to $57,123, compared with a $65,000 desired income and $34,000 from Social Security or a pension. These are planning estimates using real returns after fees of 1.8% to 5.8%, a 3.9% withdrawal rate, and a 15.0% flat tax on pre-tax accounts; planning estimate, not a guarantee.",
